{
    "word": "discipled",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "97873632-f206-395c-9d14-2ca3b3515496",
                "word": "discipled",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "526b1dbf-fe69-3a24-a8d0-dfb0a7d6c116",
                        "entry_id": "97873632-f206-395c-9d14-2ca3b3515496",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having been converted or trained as a disciple or a group of disciples."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8214c768-4603-4f29-bcbc-c6caba9462ef",
                                "sense_id": "526b1dbf-fe69-3a24-a8d0-dfb0a7d6c116",
                                "text": "See prayer as not just an element of worship but as a powerful tool to shape a discipled character in people."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57ad8016-c597-4028-93ec-c26d7cf6173a",
                                "sense_id": "526b1dbf-fe69-3a24-a8d0-dfb0a7d6c116",
                                "text": "From whence it is argued, that the Infants of notorious ungodly Parents being Members of a Discipled Nation, may therefore be baptized as such Members."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45e0ca7b-fecf-40a8-90e6-39c25ee0b284",
                                "sense_id": "526b1dbf-fe69-3a24-a8d0-dfb0a7d6c116",
                                "text": "The bibliography at the end is simply the best general bibliography I know of toward the development of a discipled mind."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d660d3a1-b67b-4a3f-8612-1d26834be19e",
                                "sense_id": "526b1dbf-fe69-3a24-a8d0-dfb0a7d6c116",
                                "text": "Christ set her free, and she is quick to proclaim that she is \"drug free, debt free, and spiritually free.\" Now she serves others as a discipled warrior in a healthy church."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dc7e9ec-be34-49e6-9f46-2fad5f50fd14",
                                "sense_id": "526b1dbf-fe69-3a24-a8d0-dfb0a7d6c116",
                                "text": "Soon missionaries coming out of discipled circles will provide most of the force required by new opportunities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa1ef076-461e-4e5c-8d83-f08847c4a147",
                                "sense_id": "526b1dbf-fe69-3a24-a8d0-dfb0a7d6c116",
                                "text": "For worship leaders and teams to effectively build a congregation as a discipled community over time, that team must value their personal lives with God over and above the opportunity to express their personal musical gift on a stage."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d91cba67-97fa-3daf-bd52-b293691cad25",
                        "entry_id": "97873632-f206-395c-9d14-2ca3b3515496",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Appropriate for a disciple; as a disciple."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "81119943-cbaf-4dbe-9deb-1acb2907b733",
                                "sense_id": "d91cba67-97fa-3daf-bd52-b293691cad25",
                                "text": "These demands have been properly tethered to renewed and repeated scriptural discernment, with the result that scriptural reality resolves exile in different ways: exile, for instance, may refer to a discipled participation in the Cross; or to an ascetic denial and yearning; or to some transtemporal pneumatic embrace; or an agonistic resistance to evil; to penitence; to the long practice of prayer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f1cdfda-c708-4559-a242-142b4cfbe461",
                                "sense_id": "d91cba67-97fa-3daf-bd52-b293691cad25",
                                "text": "If we accept a selfish gospel then we have no great motivation to engage with a discipled, sacrificial lifestyle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9efc3bf1-812d-4126-b476-3abe0f13b016",
                                "sense_id": "d91cba67-97fa-3daf-bd52-b293691cad25",
                                "text": "But an over-stressed insistence on a discipled suffering may impose too much upon those who struggle with sickness, misfortune, guilt and bereavement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a6dcd20-5d2a-4528-9b0e-4c18981e4ffa",
                                "sense_id": "d91cba67-97fa-3daf-bd52-b293691cad25",
                                "text": "These, I believe, are primary qualifications for a discipled reading."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6fb06218-1e8e-3d62-ad86-27ca0588724f",
                        "entry_id": "97873632-f206-395c-9d14-2ca3b3515496",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Serving as a student or follower of a mentor or spiritual teacher."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "54b50925-a95b-4121-9ecd-b3190bd1f717",
                                "sense_id": "6fb06218-1e8e-3d62-ad86-27ca0588724f",
                                "text": "Liu Shao-Chi in How To Be A Good Communist which was kept in print for a time in this country, emphasized that the good Communists must be thoroughly discipled in their philosophy of life; whole-heartedly dedicated even unto death; and he must be willing to participate in any phase of the revolutionary activity – all activity is considered to be revolutionary activity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b79c09e9-7ef0-42a9-9fa5-a318326a4ca4",
                                "sense_id": "6fb06218-1e8e-3d62-ad86-27ca0588724f",
                                "text": "Nanak and his discipled were given a respectful fare well by Baber."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "056c4881-ef7a-4f93-9040-4e33f9883821",
                                "sense_id": "6fb06218-1e8e-3d62-ad86-27ca0588724f",
                                "text": "A discipled person was an apprentice who learned a trade or teaching from a mentor or rabbi ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07d5cda3-7e95-4615-82ad-b83067a51d5a",
                                "sense_id": "6fb06218-1e8e-3d62-ad86-27ca0588724f",
                                "text": "According to him, if we are truly his discipled followers, at the end of the day he will acknowledge us before his Father and grant all that we need not only in this world but also in the world to come."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
